'''Balls''' are the ''main'' ''weapons'' you use to defeat enemies and clear levels in Ball X Pit.

There are 2 types of balls: '''Special Balls''' and '''Baby Balls'''. Each ball inflicts [[damage]] of a certain type(s) and can additionally inflict certain [[Status Effects|status effects]] or have other special abilities, each of which can be additionally affected by various [[passives]]. Additionally, the various damage and ability numbers on this page can also be affected by the character's base [[stats]] as well as bonuses from [[Buildings#Completion Bonus|trophies]] or other [[Buildings|buildings]].

