== Baby Balls ==
Baby Balls are regular, white balls that share the same damage and don't have any unique abilities. All [[characters]] start each run with a few of them (except for '''{{il|The Empty Nester}}''' and '''{{il|The Makeshift Sisyphus}}''') and some [[Passives]] can spawn Baby Balls. Their specific [[stats]] (Baby Ball Count and Baby Ball Damage) are affected by the {{s|l}} Leadership [[Attributes|attribute]].
Some Special Balls, especially Fused Balls can spawn Baby Balls inheriting their ablilities, unlike characters's regular Baby Balls.

