=== Evolved Balls ===
Evolved Balls are balls that are created by 2 or more specific level 3 Base or Evolved Balls together using the '''[[Fusion Reactor]]'''. These balls have their own unique name and abilities, and they can still be further fused (or even evolved again) with other balls. Some Evolved Balls can be created from more than 1 specific combination (e.g. '''Assassin''' can be created by combining ''Iron + Ghost'' '''''OR''''' ''Iron + Dark''), and note that the order of the balls '''does not''' affect the resulting evolved ball. 

There are a total of 69 Evolved Balls in the game currently.

